<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβελ-ίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβελός</span> I, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small spit, skewer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1007
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				354
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				388
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				672
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1324b19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., <i>spits</i> used as money, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fab.</u>
				27
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολός</span> fin.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>nail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.313.141
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				11(2).148.70
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>, pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			=
			<i>subula,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> window <i>bar,</i> ib.
			(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything shaped like a spit :</i> the <i>blade</i> of a
			two-edged sword, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.23.7
			</span></i> ; <i>the iron head</i> of the Roman pilum, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				5.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>obelisk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				36.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>drainage-conduit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐν τοῖς τείχεσιν ὀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.45
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).692.14
			</span></i> (Corc., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) ; so perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τοῦ πιλῶνος</span> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλῶνος</span>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ
				τοὐβιλίσκου</span> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
				ὀβελίσκου</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.391.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span> ; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀβολίσκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
